  "bio_html": "Scientist with a passion for AI innovation, committed to designing DOE experiments, clarifying MOA, and validating methods. Skilled in functional genomics, gene editing, data analysis, potency assay development, and in vitro / in vivo preclinical study design. Recognized for collaboration and meticulous creativity to ensure the delivery of high-quality medical products to patients. When I'm not working, I'm usually making DIY projects, tinkering with coding, or heading outdoors. Check out my: Movie/TV series list for watch recommendations, or read my Note-to-Self page to see what I have learned or wisdom I have heard over the years. Together, these experiences have shaped how I think: to stay curious, be patient, and always keep the real-world impact in mind.",
